SUMMARY:Blackwood
DESCRIPTION:By day\, you run a DVD store in 2012 New York. By night\, you’re a ruthless assassin. BLACKWOOD is a cinematic third-person shooter with grounded melee combat\, brutal takedowns\, responsive gunplay\, and a double life to manage. | Genres: RPG\, Strategy\, Adventure | Platforms: PC
CATEGORIES:RELEASE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:Forever Ago
DESCRIPTION:Following a tragic stroke of fate\, Alfred embarks on a journey north in search of redemption. In this single-player road trip adventure\, you'll travel to beautiful places\, capture memories with your camera\, meet interesting people\, and even make some new friends. | Genres: Adventure\, Indie | Platforms: Xbox Series X|S\, Platform 508\, PC\, PS5
CATEGORIES:RELEASE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260930
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261001
SUMMARY:Fading Echo
